{"html":"<div><h2 id=\"knowledge-about-onelaser-devices\"> Knowledge About OneLaser Devices</h2>\n<h2 id=\"maintenance-guide\"> Maintenance Guide</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/maintenance/clean-the-optical-parts\">Clean the Optical Parts</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/maintenance/laser-lens-cleaning-guide\">Laser Lens Cleaning Guide (including cleaning agent recommendations)</a></li>\n  <li><a>Laser Cutting Fire Response &amp; Prevention Guide</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/maintenance/principles-of-optical-path-adjustment\">Principles of Laser Optical Path Adjustment</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"rf-laser-tube\"> RF Laser Tube</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/maintenance/how-to-clean-dust-from-the-rf-tube-fan\">How to Clean Dust from the RF Tube Fan</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"alarm-guide\"> Alarm Guide</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/alarm-guide/x-series\">One Laser Touchscreen Alarm Guide (X Series - XRF/ XT)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"general-guide\"> General Guide</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/general/troubleshooting-ethernet-or-wifi-connection-issues\">Troubleshooting - Ethernet or Wi-Fi Connection Issues</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"laser-knowledge-popularization\"> Laser Knowledge Popularization</h2>\n<h2 id=\"laser-processing-related-parameters\"> Laser Processing Related Parameters</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/speed-explain-in-laser-world\">Speed Explain in Laser World</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/pulse-frequency-affects\">How Pulse Frequency Affects Thermal Input and Processing Effects</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/wavelength-blue-fiber\">Laser wavelength science popularization: Blue laser (455 nm) vs Fiber laser (1064 nm)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/laser-focus\">Understanding Laser Focus: Focal Spot Size, Depth of Field, and Their Impact on Engraving Quality</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/minimize-carbonization\">Minimize Carbonization Through The Coordinated Adjustment of Parameters</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/corner-power\">Corner Power Control in Laser Cutting: Preventing Overheating at Sharp Edges</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/kerf-compensation\">Kerf Compensation in Laser Cutting: Understanding and Correcting Material Loss</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/scanning-direction-and-engraving-modes\">Optimizing Grating Engraving in Laser Systems: Scanning Direction and Engraving Modes Explained</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"special-process-principle\"> Special Process Principle</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/laser-metal-color-marking\">The principle of laser metal color marking</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/popularization/grayscale-image-processing\">Understanding Grayscale Image Processing for Laser Engraving</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"laser-equipment-hardware\"> Laser Equipment Hardware</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/maintenance/optical-path-system\">A Comprehensive Analysis of Optical Path System: Materials, Coatings, and Maintenance of Mirrors</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/hardware/stepper-motors-and-servo-motors\">Laser Machine Motors: Stepper Motors vs. Servo Motors</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"material-processing-knowledge-base\"> Material Processing Knowledge Base</h2>\n<h2 id=\"different-materials-parameters\"> <strong>Different Materials Parameters</strong></h2>\n<p>Unlock the full potential of your OneLaser Machine with optimized settings for various materials.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/38w\">38W (RF)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/55w\">55W (CO2)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/80w\">80W (CO2)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/100w\">100W (CO2)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/130w\">130W (CO2)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/different-materials-parameters/150w\">150W (CO2)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"wood-materials\"> Wood Materials</h2>\n<h3 id=\"plywood\"> Plywood</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/wood-materials/plywood\">Plywood Selection Guide</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/wood-materials/plywood-laser-processing-best-practices\">Plywood Laser Processing Best Practices</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/wood-materials/plywood-cutting-troubleshooting-overview\">Plywood Cutting Troubleshooting</a></li>\n  <li>Plywood Engraving Troubleshooting</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"mdf\"> MDF</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/mdf/mdf-selection-guide\">MDF Selection Guide</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/mdf/mdf-laser-processing-best-practices\">MDF Laser Processing Best Practices</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/knowledge-base/material-processing/mdf/mdf-troubleshooting\">MDF Troubleshooting</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"basswood\"> Basswood</h3>\n<p>Basswood Guide</p>\n<h3 id=\"hardwood\"> Hardwood</h3>\n<p>Hardwood Guide</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/111\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">111</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"acrylic-materials\"> Acrylic Materials</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/k